{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26879","headline":"题河上亭 · 姚合","name":"题河上亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭亭河上亭，鱼踯水禽鸣。\n九曲何时尽，千峰今日清。\n晨光秋更远，暑气夏常轻。\n桮里移樯影，琴中有浪声。\n岸莎连砌静，渔火入窗明。\n来此多沈醉，神高无宿酲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}